  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UICOVAAZ Artisans Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UICOVAAZ is based in the city of Agadez and promotes economic and social development for its members through the production and marketing of locally manufactured arti-sanal products. USADF funds will increase production and sales of jewelry and fine leather products. UICOVAAZ will develop and strengthen its management, financial structures and policies.</narrative>
  </description>
